  "contentHtml": "<p>정오각형이 아닌 오각형의 무게중심을 구하는 방법의 오차에 관해 이승윤 선생님이 조언해 주셨습니다. (아래 360번 방)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이승윤 선생님의 도움말이 아니었다면, 모르고 지나쳤을 문제입니다. 지면을 빌어 다시금 감사드립니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아래의 동영상을 보니까 무시할 정도의 오차 범위는 아닌 것 같습니다.&#160;&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-6XkETmeXkY\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-6XkETmeXkY</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-6XkETmeXkY\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/qkSwU/hyZRqRJnmW/uwlfgFX9G09PYtUfCMpkm1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=342_98_402_162\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-6XkETmeXkY\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KHn9oq4oqnc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KHn9oq4oqnc</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KHn9oq4oqnc\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/gY0IU/hyZQKCvcPi/WbS1sTIUti6KPHPhfOrWu1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=342_106_394_164\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KHn9oq4oqnc\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \